### UPDATE Account Passsword
PATCH {{host}}/user/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
x-Version: {{x-version}}

{
  "oldPassword": "Licma888!",
  "newPassword": "NoviPassword"
}

### Upload personal user image
POST {{host}}/user/personal-image
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
x-Version: {{x-version}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="markob.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/developer/Downloads/markob.jpeg
--WebAppBoundary--

### Upload user image
POST {{host}}/user/image
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
x-Version: {{x-version}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="serbiangamesbl-majca.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/developer/Downloads/serbiangamesbl-majca.jpeg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

f9a267a5-38bd-11f1-916b-df41a98aba05
--WebAppBoundary--

### Upload user image (userId in route)
POST {{host}}/user/image/f9a267a5-38bd-11f1-916b-df41a98aba05
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
x-Version: {{x-version}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="serbiangamesbl-majca.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/developer/Downloads/serbiangamesbl-majca.jpeg
--WebAppBoundary--


